<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Jesus, the Son and the man,</l><l>Coming from and with the Father,</l><l>Doing the Father’s will here on earth</l><l>Even nailed on the cross.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Becoming the life-giving Spirit,</l><l>Consummation of the One who</l><l>Comes into us and flows through us</l><l>As we call on Him!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
